### FilmFuse core-api - one rating and its comments. Token: see me.http.
# Visibility follows rating.repository.RatingVisibilitySql: 404 when you can't see the rating;
# comments by people blocked either way are hidden (and not counted in commentCount).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@ratingId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@commentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### One rating as a feed item (rating detail screen; includes commentCount)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ratings/{{ratingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Comments, oldest first, 30 per page (pass nextCursor as ?cursor=)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ratings/{{ratingId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a comment (201; body 1-500 chars after trimming). Emails the rating's author if they allow it
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ratings/{{ratingId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"body": "Totally agree about the ending."}

### Delete (204 for the comment's or the rating's author; 403 others; 404 unknown/hidden)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Empty body -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ratings/{{ratingId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"body": "   "}
